sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Swift client
  participant K as Keystone
  participant G as radosgw
  C->>K: authenticate (user, password, project)
  K-->>C: token + catalog (endpoint: RGW)
  C->>G: GET /swift/v1/AUTH_proj/container  X-Auth-Token
  G->>K: validate the token (with the service user)
  K-->>G: project and roles
  G->>G: automatically create an RGW user for the project (first time)
  G-->>C: object listing
